		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Globular spider-thing with six crab-claws, a three-eyed orb- head, and elephantine trunk. Glyphic statues are scattered across existence.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 77, <strong>ATK</strong> 6 claw +6 (2d6 + grab) and 1 feed, <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly, swim), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +5, <strong>I</strong> +4, <strong>W</strong> +4, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 16</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Feed</strong>. Drain fluids, CON 15+ or lose 2d4 CON permanently.</p><p></p><p><strong>Grab</strong>. STR 18+ or held. STR 18+ on turn to break free.</p><p></p><p><strong>Madness</strong>. Warps reality for all mortals within far. Each turn, WIS 18+ or DISADV.</p><p></p><p><strong>Pure Evil</strong>. Only damaged by magic sources. Turns into nigh-indestructible statue if reduced to 0 HP, reborn from statue when the stars align.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
